---
import Telemetry from "./Telemetry.astro";
---

<section id="story" class="fade-section site-section site-section--story">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="site-section-heading">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="site-copy-grid">
      <p>
        Steel Muse is the result of 30 years of invention and entrepreneurship.
        We didn't learn innovation in a classroom. We learned it on the front
        lines - founding companies, building technologies, and securing
        intellectual property at an industrial scale.
      </p>
      <p>
        We know the friction that slows serious founders down. We built Steel
        Muse to solve it. We've distilled decades of executive leadership and
        invention into a system you can leverage today.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="site-story-grid">
      <article class="site-founder-panel">
        <div class="site-founder-panel__image">
          <img src="/images/headshot.png" alt="Peter Sweeney" class="bio-image" />
        </div>
        <div class="site-founder-panel__meta">Founder / The Architect</div>
        <h3>Peter Sweeney</h3>
        <p>
          A seasoned entrepreneur and prolific inventor whose experience
          directly informs every system we build. Peter has served in executive
          roles (CEO, CTO, COO) across four ventures, leading teams from
          early-stage invention to institutional scale.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="site-dossier-panel">
        <div class="site-dossier-panel__header">
          <span>Technical Dossier</span>
          <a href="/patents">View Issued Patents</a>
        </div>
        <h3>Deep Technical Experience</h3>
        <p>
          We speak the language of inventors because we are inventors. Our
          background involves decades of hands-on technical development. This
          allows us to rapidly deconstruct complex innovations and translate
          them into robust asset strategies without the friction often found
          between legal and engineering teams.
        </p>

        <div class="site-capability-list">
          <div class="site-capability">
            <div class="site-capability__label">Systems Architecture</div>
            <div class="site-capability__value">Generative AI & Data Synthesis</div>
          </div>
          <div class="site-capability">
            <div class="site-capability__label">Agent Systems</div>
            <div class="site-capability__value">
              Explanatory State Modeling & User-Directed Networking
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="site-capability">
            <div class="site-capability__label">Knowledge Engineering</div>
            <div class="site-capability__value">
              Kinematic Data Modeling & Semantic Representation
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <Telemetry />

    <div class="site-timeline">
      <div class="site-timeline__label">Experience Distilled From Category-Defining Ventures</div>
      <div class="site-timeline__grid">
        <article class="site-timeline__item">
          <img src="/images/indimensions-logo.png" alt="InDIMENSIONS logo" class="venture-logo" />
          <p><strong>InDIMENSIONS (1996-2001)</strong><br />E-Business Infrastructure</p>
          <div class="venture-lesson">Lesson: Infrastructure</div>
        </article>
        <article class="site-timeline__item">
          <img src="/images/occ-logo.png" alt="Official Community logo" class="venture-logo" />
          <p><strong>Official Community (2001-2025)</strong><br />Direct-to-Fan Scale</p>
          <div class="venture-lesson">Lesson: Scale</div>
        </article>
        <article class="site-timeline__item">
          <a href="https://www.primal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <img src="/images/primal-logo.png" alt="Primal logo" class="venture-logo" />
          </a>
          <p><strong>Primal (2004-Present)</strong><br />Generative AI & Semantic Synthesis</p>
          <div class="venture-lesson">Lesson: Invention</div>
        </article>
        <article class="site-timeline__item">
          <a href="/">
            <img src="/images/steelmuse-logo.png" alt="Steel Muse logo" class="venture-logo" />
          </a>
          <p><strong>Steel Muse (2018-Present)</strong><br />Institutional Innovation</p>
          <div class="venture-lesson">Lesson: Commercialization</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
